silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_05_absorption_law_sections_01_absorption_arrow_concrete_anchor silm:hasExample "In 'AbsorptionArrowConcreteAnchor', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, the governed Mittens individual at Tartu Animal Clinic, annual vet exam 2026-05-18; also, The absorption arrow alpha from raw cannon text about cheese-trap (cannon/cheese.md warning about rational mastery) to the typed OlogNode CheeseTrapWarning in G_Granite; alpha carries the interpretation as a typed morphism; also, Icechunk chunk c-0x7f4a: Tartu vet-record payload, sha256:7f4a...bf2c, evidence leg." .
